        {
          "path": "_m/u/s/d/7/honningsvag-church-wp/church-in-honningsvag-20170221.jpg",
          "filename": "Church in Honningsvåg 20170221 171708.jpg",
          "caption": "Day Two on MS Trollfjord ...\nHere, it was not as cold as I expected it might be ... there was no wind chill. Despite only being 1311 miles away from the North Pole, and well into the Arctic Circle!\n\nWe docked at Honningsvag at 12:00 (only an hour late) where we stayed until 15:45. We had lunch in a lovely little place called Arctic Sans. We had the Norwegian version of a club sandwich (toasted, melty and hot) with a beer. One beer. One small beer. Beer is not cheap here! One small beer is about £7.50.",
          "alt": "Day Two on MS Trollfjord ...\nHere, it was not as cold as I expected it might be ... there was no wind chill. Despite only being 1311 miles away from the North Pole, and well into the Arctic Circle!\n\nWe docked at Honningsvag at 12:00 (only an hour late) where we stayed until 15:45. We had lunch in a lovely little place called Arctic Sans. We had the Norwegian version of a club sandwich (toasted, melty and hot) with a beer. One beer. One small beer. Beer is not cheap here! One small beer is about £7.50.",
          "width": 3864,
          "height": 5152,
          "mimeType": "image/jpeg",
          "license": "CC BY-SA 2.0",
          "artist": "Leonora (Ellie) Enking from East Preston, United Kingdom",
          "sourceUrl": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Church_in_Honningsv%C3%A5g_20170221_171708.jpg",
          "sourceType": "commons-category",
          "sourceArticleId": "honningsvag-church-wp",
          "sourceGeohash4": "usd7",
          "mediumPath": "_m/u/s/d/7/honningsvag-church-wp/church-in-honningsvag-20170221-medium.webp",
